msgstr ""
"Is é an bealach molta chun gléasanna Android agus Apple iOS a shioncronú ná "
"úsáid a bhaint as `aipeanna soghluaiste oifigiúla Nextcloud "
"<https://nextcloud.com/install/>`_."

